{"channelId":"UCBaK1umRVZIaCi9o4BlQQTA","row":["Rehab and Revive",316000,"The mission of the R+ YouTube Department is to leverage the power of video content to amplify our commitment to delivering excellence in enduring healing services and to extend our impact to a global audience. Through engaging and informative videos, we aim to empower our community by providing valuable insights, education, and inspiration on pain management, rehabilitation, and wellness. By fostering a culture of creativity, collaboration, and continuous improvement, we strive to strengthen our online presence, expand our reach, and solidify R+ as a trusted resource and preferred destination for health-related content on YouTube. Through our global community outreach efforts, we seek to connect with individuals around the world, inspire belief in our collective ability to make a positive impact, and foster a supportive community dedicated to healing and wellness\n\nHeal Smarter Not Harder,\nDr. Justin C. Lin","hello@rehabandrevive.com","United States"],"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCBaK1umRVZIaCi9o4BlQQTA","biographySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCBaK1umRVZIaCi9o4BlQQTA","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:02:06.117Z","channelId":"UCBaK1umRVZIaCi9o4BlQQTA","sourceType":"about","contentHash":"9410110002aaad1b891fc8890e1a07d7a386a007c3f14407ac7918b3492b6048","complete":true,"readStatus":"read","captureSha256":"a5fe0e7d759ca8dfc2216403217d0841be76e59bf4c7366b678095cd5bf67521"},"countrySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCBaK1umRVZIaCi9o4BlQQTA","observedAt":"2026-09-18T09:17:53.043Z"},"followerAccounts":[{"platform":"youtube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCBaK1umRVZIaCi9o4BlQQTA","identityStatus":"channel_published","value":316000,"raw":"316K subscribers","precision":"rounded","sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCBaK1umRVZIaCi9o4BlQQTA","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:02:06.117Z"}],"emails":[{"address":"hello@rehabandrevive.com"